<title>UK: SOCCER-N.IRELAND BEAT ALBANIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-N.IRELAND BEAT ALBANIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Ireland beat Albania 2-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup European group nine qualifier in Belfast on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Iain Dowie 12, 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,935  </p>
<p>    Group nine standings   Pl  W   D   L   F  A   Pts</p>
<p> Portugal			4   2   1   1   5   2   7</p>
<p> Ukraine			 3   2   0   1   3   2   6</p>
<p> Northern Ireland	    4   1   2   1   4   3   5</p>
<p> Germany			 2   1   1   0   6   2   4</p>
<p> Armenia			 4   0   3   1   3   7   3</p>
<p> Albania			 3   0   1   2   1   6   1</p>
</text>
